{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 在 S02、S04 等段落的感受词组比较密集，即使小字和分时出现能减轻负担，快速扫屏时仍不如 Y 的左右分栏容易定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的【】能让观众迅速抓住每段心理变化的核心，而分时出现的感受又能跟着音乐逐步展开，不只是告诉观众他难过或高兴，还能让人感到情绪怎样升起、受阻、回落和再次涌动。水波、小船、声线等反复出现的线索也加强了前后连贯性。Y 的左右分栏确实更容易扫读，叙述也更口语流畅，但部分音乐过程和人物心理的细微转折被概括掉了，尤其是期待中夹着不安、幸福中逐渐渗入失落的层次，X 保留得更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8258708b-9f3b-4a79-bd1c-a44a39918738", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231716425796Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:18:29.239565+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9e99d3ab94271b4bd3487684e5260b70b858df9d4b4a1dc8aaf78169da11b612", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool